  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "可微分的函数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "事实上，",
        "$(a_0x^n+a_1x^{n-1}+\\cdots+a_{n-1}x+a_n)'↵=(a_0x^n)'+(a_1x^{n-1})'+\\cdots+(a_{n-1}x)'+(a_n)'↵=na_0x^{n-1}+(n-1)a_1x^{n-2}+\\cdots+a_{n-1}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 1. $(x^{10})'=10x^9$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 2. $(5x^4+4x^3+3x^2+2x+1)'=5\\cdot4x^3+4\\cdot3x^2+3\\cdot2x↵+2=20x^3+12x^2+6x+2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习　题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求下列各函数的导数："
      ],
      "owner_exercises": [
        "375",
        "376"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "375",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) $f(x)=x^4$；　б) $g(x)=x^3$；　в) $h(x)=(x-4)^4$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "376",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) $f(x)=2x^5-3x^4+7x^2-5x+9$；",
        "б) $g(x)=7-2x^3+x^4-3x^9$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "377",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作下列各函数的图象：",
        "а) $y=x^2(x-2)$；　б) $y=x^3-6x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "47. 商的导数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理. 如果函数 $u$ 和 $v$ 在点 $x$ 有导数，而且 $v(x)\\ne0$，那",
        "么它们的商 $\\frac{u}{v}$ 在这点也有导数，这个导数由公式",
        "$(\\frac{u}{v})'=\\frac{u'v-uv'}{v^2}$",
        "给出。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明　用 $w$ 表示商 $\\frac{u}{v}$。这时"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "• 160 •"
      ]
    }
  ]
}

